# Descriptor: [anti-B0 -> D'_1+ l- nu, D'_1+ -> D+ eta] gap mode (resonant)
# NickName: B0_Dp1lnu_DEta_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode study; D'_1 -> D eta using wide PHSP sub-decay. Isospin partner of
#   decfiles/gap_modes/Bplus/Dp1Deta (D'_10 -> D0 eta), generated by the full-isospin
#   generalization of the SEM/Hausdorff pipeline: charged D'_10/D0 -> D'_1+/D+.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260831

Alias Dp1eta0sig D'_1+
Alias anti-Dp1eta0sig D'_1-
ChargeConj Dp1eta0sig anti-Dp1eta0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.500 Dp1eta0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 Dp1eta0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay Dp1eta0sig
1.0 D+ eta PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-Dp1eta0sig

End
